Subject: [PATCH v2] crypto: arm64/sha: fix function types
From:   Sami Tolvanen <samitolvanen@google.com>
To:     Herbert Xu <herbert@gondor.apana.org.au>,
        Ard Biesheuvel <ard.biesheuvel@linaro.org>,
